  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the speaker's current situation",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the speaker of the meme, who is contrasting their own life (with a 4-year degree) with their parents' life (with a high school diploma). The text 'than i do with a 4 year degree' directly references the speaker's personal experience, and the user, as the viewer, is positioned as identifying with this speaker and their situation. The party scene, which represents the parents' 'better' life, is juxtaposed against the speaker's current state, which the user is invited to see as less successful despite the degree. The user is thus projected onto the speaker's personal narrative and their current life circumstances.",
